## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & VERDICT

The **LINK X8** (formerly NER-LogiAI) system is a full-stack, multimodal logistics optimization and accessibility intelligence command platform engineered for the 8 North Eastern States of India (Assam, Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, Nagaland, Manipur, Mizoram, Tripura, Sikkim). 

The platform addresses terrain vulnerability, single-point bridge failure risks, extreme monsoon weather, landslide disruptions, and multi-modal logistics bottlenecks across 14 key transit corridors and 45+ critical districts.

```
