                          EXECUTIVE AUDIT SCORECARD
================================================================================
1. Architecture & UI/UX Design         : 9.6 / 10 (High Polish, Glassmorphism, 20 Pages)
2. Local Database & State Cascades     : 9.4 / 10 (Full Relational Consistency & Triggers)
3. Live External Meteorological Feed   : 9.8 / 10 (Live HTTPS Open-Meteo Integration)
4. Telemetry & SSE Streaming Engine    : 8.8 / 10 (Functional SSE Push & Geo Ingestion)
5. Offline Field Resilience            : 9.0 / 10 (Client-side Queue & Deduplicated Sync)
6. Vehicle Suitability / Bridge Matrix : 9.2 / 10 (Accurate GVW vs Bridge Load Logic)
7. Government Ingestion Gateways       : 7.2 / 10 (Hybrid / Fallback Mocked Catalogs)
8. Machine Learning Realism            : 6.8 / 10 (Heuristic / Synthetic Dataset)
9. API Authorization & RBAC Lockdown   : 7.5 / 10 (Supabase Layer Added; Core Routes Need Strict Token Dep)
10. Multi-Machine Production Readiness : 8.5 / 10 (Environment-configurable CORS/Host)
================================================================================
OVERALL SYSTEM MATURITY RATING         : 8.6 / 10 (ENTERPRISE-READY SIH PROTOTYPE)
