| `/api/v1/telemetry/phone-gps` | POST | **LIVE INGESTION** | Ingests real GPS coordinates from browser `navigator.geolocation`. |
| `/api/v1/telemetry/health` | GET | **LIVE DATABASE** | Evaluates heartbeat timestamps (LIVE, RECENT, STALE, OFFLINE). |
| `/api/v1/telemetry/simulate-step` | POST | **SIMULATION** | Advances simulated fleet along predefined corridor waypoints. |
| `/api/v1/device-hardware/ping` | POST | **LIVE INGESTION** | Ingests real hardware OBD-II/GPS tracker packets with CRC verification. |
| `/api/v1/device-hardware/devices` | GET | **LIVE DATABASE** | Lists registered physical GPS hardware units and signal strengths. |

